# Template for ~/.config/gtk-3.0/bookmarks — the shortcut list in GTK file
# dialogs' sidebar. Personal, so it's NOT tracked (delete this comment when
# you copy it):  cp examples/bookmarks ~/.config/gtk-3.0/bookmarks
